# ==============================================================================
# 5. Booking Retrieval API (`GET /api/v1/bookings/:bookingId`)
# ==============================================================================

### Get Booking Details by ID (Auto-captured from Step 3 createBooking)
GET {{bookings}}/{{bookingId}}
Accept: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}


### Get Booking Details via Direct booking-service Endpoint
GET {{bookingService}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Accept: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}


### Get Booking Details - FAIL Case: Invalid bookingId UUID -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{bookings}}/invalid-booking-uuid
Accept: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}


### Get Booking Details - FAIL Case: Non-existent Booking ID -> 404 Not Found
GET {{bookings}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}



# ==============================================================================
# 6. Booking Cancellation API (`POST /api/v1/bookings/:bookingId/cancel`)
# ==============================================================================

### Cancel Booking (Auto-captured {{bookingId}})
POST {{bookings}}/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}


### Cancel Booking - FAIL Case: Non-existent Booking ID -> 404 Not Found
POST {{bookings}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}



# ==============================================================================
# 7. Real-Time Booking Events Stream (`GET /api/v1/bookings/:bookingId/events`)
# ==============================================================================

### Stream Real-Time Booking Status Events (SSE)
GET {{bookings}}/{{bookingId}}/events
Accept: text/event-stream
x-user-id: {{userId}}

